{"id": "738161194347912"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1074030017069025", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "NeuroBoostVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Zv\u00fd\u0161te \u017eivotn\u00fd \u0161t\u00fdl s NeuroBoostVR! \n\ud83e\udde0 Pre akt\u00edvny mozog a inovat\u00edvne cvi\u010denie je tu NeuroBoostVR! Virtu\u00e1lna realita pre Oculus Quest vylep\u0161uje jemn\u00fa motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu.\n\n\ud83c\udf08 Pre\u010do NeuroBoostVR? \n\u2705 Denn\u00e1 rutina v novom svete: Cvi\u010dte mozog a nervov\u00fd syst\u00e9m v z\u00e1bavn\u00fdch \u00faloh\u00e1ch a cvi\u010deniach. \n\u2705 Personalizovan\u00e9 tr\u00e9ningy: Vyberte cvi\u010denia pre motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu. \n\u2705 Z\u00e1bava v ka\u017edej \u00falohe: Chy\u0165te mot\u00fdle, otvorte trezor, cho\u010fte po moste a in\u00e9 \u00falohy pre rados\u0165 z ka\u017edodenn\u00fdch aktiv\u00edt.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Presu\u0148te svet do virtu\u00e1lnej reality: S NeuroBoostVR cvi\u010d\u00edte doma s fyzickou a ment\u00e1lnou stimul\u00e1ciou. \n\ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd Pre seniorov s neurologick\u00fdmi probl\u00e9my: NeuroBoostVR zlep\u0161uje denn\u00e9 zru\u010dnosti v virtu\u00e1lnej realite.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Vst\u00fapte do sveta inov\u00e1ci\u00ed s NeuroBoostVR! Stiahnite si na Oculus Quest pre nov\u00fd rozmer cvi\u010denia! \ud83d\udd25", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Zv\u00fd\u0161te \u017eivotn\u00fd \u0161t\u00fdl s NeuroBoostVR! \n\n\ud83e\udde0 Pre akt\u00edvny mozog a inovat\u00edvne cvi\u010denie je tu NeuroBoostVR! Virtu\u00e1lna realita pre Oculus Quest vylep\u0161uje jemn\u00fa motoriku, rovnov\u00e1hu a orient\u00e1ciu.\n\n\ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd Pre seniorov s neurologick\u00fdmi probl\u00e9my: NeuroBoostVR zlep\u0161uje denn\u00e9 zru\u010dnosti v virtu\u00e1lnej realite.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "3715489735443944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223475_3715489738777277_6725514994967281094_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=acnhn5TQIaYQ7kNvwHyFlC2&_nc_oc=AdrsWhWyyN_WAfkEqKKDD3UMpUPMjEdTvlG9TPvAaR8zss3AEukESo_x3jsisdDO5j4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCH3Y45o-Wo09FvuV3V7CssXloxZbIr7QYwkGqWOygSw&oe=6AE33F7A"}, {"file_name": "NeuroBoostVR-logos_white.png", "id": "1449299835652595", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031588_1449299838985928_3273656360243060538_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53ond26SGZ0Q7kNvwHW_g4Q&_nc_oc=AdrAZgt-I3ion0ahNfVrc2QMKxfLhz09cqOESLFONnN_CCB2fEfgAiYr59DNl4e_LOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPJD3eVxSwdW_8QhTWpBS9fsE6HZCEhzkNUAFY0zracAQ&oe=6AE340E3"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "914639506755776", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_914639510089109_4964949883562545877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OIybJo67G5cQ7kNvwHTMGLc&_nc_oc=AdoxMwwxEx9SxEiG-GecsK09NE0x0sBYev0PKtX3eIPK0w0qz55J4VEJw8A8x7zhQP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNLQHLWwQ9b7QS4wlXXTvFVj3aqbSgpZTmAxAdnitCtLQ&oe=6AE3406B"}, {"file_name": "mini_landscape.png", "id": "708521497648808", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974893_708521500982141_5155930483829372086_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y0a9Pk7xomcQ7kNvwFJraPs&_nc_oc=AdrvyZZ3u_RwMU0n3DNgDdOMgMxaTs2R8Ej6hEYoJ-UydXCwe0uxy6FXxOiz2Clh8dA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNVapg_8tg1g2OfEgEZwhRPRZYk0weKwSSlwbjfLP9Zdw&oe=6AE33CA1"}, {"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "394662836224913", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422395_394662839558246_9040475886420007254_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Iy6egtzoy8MQ7kNvwHGt-_s&_nc_oc=Adox8ifGdpIK49S-nvUA61PNTny-XxvLqCqomKDQBpuDj4yq5CfiHtQM7MeDNIf2TBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMoaya5cOAybmCUmm8SQ9q5EXHvOrnO6ZnfpdiAU6oBCg&oe=6AE3643E"}, {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "390055040042529", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031399_390055043375862_6696706312084936751_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=88gO6IHoeNIQ7kNvwE0IDRn&_nc_oc=AdqaiDe31vkf_ZR33QkG-r3fmjW6D5o1shYRkOyzUCga3ogax_XjQ9ouDG71N7R4b50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOH9XCGlsZ2B3XBl5JnNKXsLVvtUK2TZ9YRIuxn8yQmYA&oe=6AE3536E"}, {"file_name": "hero_cover.png", "id": "368365122343068", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035396_368365125676401_1649411097199154561_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RE-1z0zUeKkQ7kNvwHHPFGD&_nc_oc=Adr0PSIRw70PNyynz6TD6BrN6465BVOiYN07rYpAKTdLYgoGykz9EQoHwnVGtsw662c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMrPMyD3duGZDJKVIa7hncdx6sKOHc3_KaUuqQflzJXJg&oe=6AE35F08"}]}, "id": "845033043961390", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00000_cr.png", "id": "668670848669663", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540503_668670852002996_5957302336769620359_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XEVIt1fvUKMQ7kNvwFmiNUa&_nc_oc=Adp7OcJDEGsFIsIYHvLvfQWBbfOVTR26deqPT3aI5UP1__4nwVheSitojQe8_eaE1hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOTq8RHBXTOb8q9BbRGOq8TFJs6LfwARwXzajgh67Sykw&oe=6AE36719"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00001_cr.png", "id": "1707421716404196", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035434_1707421723070862_1881570540579653944_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3TzPTdYQuLwQ7kNvwHRdhDI&_nc_oc=AdotxfPYwPjSP4gJyzMgdTR7aquqKi56f9ED-RyWjrNkd8ujPIVmm5aQjGBkHGKAdqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO7cIhkTY1_OoY3LDJoCv8ICxw4gg-engAaH-MYLmJAbw&oe=6AE34E24"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00002_cr.png", "id": "656378790033982", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_656378793367315_5326444234208413663_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B5hpgkvjvEYQ7kNvwERkSvW&_nc_oc=Adol5_f78YISGq_x6zPu0ZxJ2Ey5OeAwtPganu59h9sWry8RTYPyVW2smZuj4lL8_h4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOY-d_FpgN2Q8xiW_6Ryq04cpb2em857I58KPen5Q-sGg&oe=6AE3410B"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00003_cr.png", "id": "373511228509371", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575362_373511231842704_987523795937543327_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jHRtwdUgO-4Q7kNvwGY3cMC&_nc_oc=Adpqvokzp36wIywQ4mrCaeyPPXJGkBMzSJukY1rHsmedJqYLkDtEbmb1WAaSEFIN3vg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM4sHkFMAPItT0-Nv_TrdPiaYEdHzTJYryuWwrX8UrOXg&oe=6AE346E8"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00005_cr.png", "id": "907397567493320", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_907397570826653_5134560045346274448_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cyYf0SaKdDwQ7kNvwGOu-tC&_nc_oc=AdpZBEar8Ns8LytHFLuOQDtXcS09waZ6npwsTZFhBDR0-uOw1-EBDFuL_outjH5eTFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSyXypjQ0B7pn7RlSbd5jsK4CXak6HSDB4BtovwBllBw&oe=6AE36D02"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "NeuroBoostVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Elevate Your Lifestyle with NeuroBoostVR! \n\n\ud83e\udde0 Whether you're a senior keeping your brain active or craving innovative exercise, NeuroBoostVR is here! Our Oculus Quest app improves motor skills, balance, and spatial orientation.\n\n\ud83c\udf08 Why NeuroBoostVR? \n\n\u2705 Daily routine in a new world: Fun tasks and exercises in a virtual environment. \n\u2705 Personalized workouts: Choose exercises for motor skills, balance, and orientation. \n\u2705 Fun in every task: Catch butterflies, open a safe, walk on a bridge, and more!\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Move your world into VR: Exercise at home with physical and mental stimulation. \n\n\ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd For seniors and those with neurological issues: NeuroBoostVR enhances life, helping exercise brains and daily skills in virtual reality.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Step into innovation with NeuroBoostVR! Create your wellness program in our virtual world supporting a healthy lifestyle. \n\ud83d\udd25 Download NeuroBoostVR on Oculus Quest for a new dimension of exercise!", "short_description": "\ud83d\ude80 Elevate Life with NeuroBoostVR! \ud83e\udde0 For seniors or anyone seeking fun, innovative exercise, our Oculus Quest app enhances motor skills and balance.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d VR at Home: Enjoy physical and mental stimulation without leaving home. \ud83d\udc75\ud83c\udffd\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffd For seniors and those with neurological issues: NeuroBoostVR improves daily skills in virtual reality.\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Step into innovation with NeuroBoostVR! Download on Oculus Quest for a new dimension of exercise! \ud83d\udd25"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gametherapy.eu/assets/docu/privacy_policy.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GAMETHERAPY", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gametherapy.eu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ad